OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother bright and mostly sunny
OL,6,Fday across the region with patchy
OL,7,Fcloud in the northwest. Rather warm in
OL,8,Fthe sunshine, with temperatures above
OL,9,Faverage across the region.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry this evening and
OL,12,Fovernight with variable amounts of
OL,13,Fcloud. Thicker cloud arrives across
OL,14,Fthe north of the region towards dawn
OL,15,Fwith outbreaks of light and patchy
OL,16,Frain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
