OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FOvercast with outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain, this l, becoming locally heavy
OL,7,Fand persistent across the north of the
OL,8,Fregion. Turning drier and brighter
OL,9,Ffrom the west during the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FLargely settled through Thursday and
OL,13,FFriday, with chilly nights and bright,
OL,14,Fsunny days. Temperatures will feel
OL,15,Fwarm in the sunshine. Increasing
OL,16,Fcloudy from Saturday, bringing the
OL,17,Frisk of some rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
